# PERSONAL

INTERNAL

sync-from-*

# Written by Claude Code when it loads a mod: the types in .claude-plugin/types/,
# and a tsconfig.json beside them that extends those types. A session writes both
# again, so neither belongs to the project.
**/.claude-plugin/types/
**/claude-code/
**/claude-code-tools/
**/claude-code-mcp/
mods/*/tsconfig.json
templates/*/tsconfig.json
learn/**/tsconfig.json

# Local lesson state, if created while developing; clones are not lesson workspaces by default.
/.claude-mod-lab/

# Optional local mod experiments; lesson work normally lives in a dedicated workspace.
/workshop/

# Components the explorer adds to a session (Add to session); each is yours to edit.
/.claude/skills/

antipasta*
sites
